# Xyce: level 57 is BSIMSOI, no pss, fmod and db (63f08969, part f).
# What the fix was for, as the ledger has it: the card reads with family `bsimsoi` (not an `is not
# in the xyce models table` error) and is written `.model ms nmos level=10`.
from: xyce
to: ngspice
--- input
t
.model ms nmos level=57
.end
--- output
t
.model ms nmos level=10
.end
--- report
